WEBVTT

00:02.000 --> 00:03.200
I'm not drunk

00:03.280 --> 00:04.200
Don't need hangover soup

00:04.280 --> 00:05.680
Your Highness

00:05.840 --> 00:07.440
Are you afraid I put

00:07.720 --> 00:09.120
Poison in this soup?

00:18.280 --> 00:19.680
Your Highness

00:20.440 --> 00:22.440
Now you can be at ease

00:30.600 --> 00:32.600
The hangover soup has herbs added

00:32.960 --> 00:35.293
Tomorrow you won't have a hangover headache

00:46.240 --> 00:47.680
I'm afraid I should go

00:47.760 --> 00:49.760
Wan'er respectfully sees off Your Highness

00:59.920 --> 01:01.320
Ruolan

01:01.800 --> 01:02.880
I'll learn from it later

01:02.960 --> 01:04.480
The food at other people's residences

01:04.560 --> 01:05.440
So no one will

01:05.520 --> 01:07.240
Worry that you're tired of it

01:07.320 --> 01:08.987
Or that I'm starving you

01:16.440 --> 01:18.760
The smell of alcohol is so strong

01:18.840 --> 01:20.000
Go back and rest early

01:20.080 --> 01:21.960
You stay up all night reading documents

01:22.040 --> 01:22.520
That light

01:22.600 --> 01:24.267
Keeps me from sleeping well

01:25.280 --> 01:27.200
I respectfully obey Her Highness's decree

